--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers this project's own code. Bundled and referenced
third-party work keeps its own terms, which are not altered by it.

MapLibre GL JS v6.15.0 — BSD-3-Clause
  Redistributed in source form at shared/map/vendor/maplibre-gl.mjs and
  maplibre-gl-worker.mjs. Full notice, including the bundled mapbox-gl-js
  (BSD-3-Clause) and glfx.js (MIT) notices, at shared/map/vendor/LICENSE.txt.

Map data and tiles — not redistributed here, fetched at runtime
  OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), OpenFreeMap, OpenTopoMap (CC-BY-SA,
  non-commercial use only), and Esri/Maxar/Earthstar Geographics imagery.
  Credits are rendered in the interface, which the check suite asserts.
  shared/map/README.md records each source's terms, and is explicit that the
  Esri position has not been confirmed.

Route geometry under apps/day-02-lines/
  Derived from the OpenStreetMap network via Valhalla, so ODbL attaches.
  See apps/day-02-lines/README.md.

Windows XP and its "Luna" theme, "Bliss" and "Clippy" are Microsoft's. This
project is an homage and contains no Microsoft files: the wallpaper is CSS
gradients and the assistant is hand-drawn SVG. No affiliation or endorsement is
claimed.
